WEBVTT

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:34.130
Go!
Dranzer Gigus Turbo!

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:41.450
What?!

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:45.370
So you like
moves like those.

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:48.250
So...

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:00.420
What?!

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.920
What was that?

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:03.770
The same attack as Kai!

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:05.970
No way!

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.500
He copied my move!

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:17.600
Are you interested now?

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:19.250
Here we go.

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:24.170
Kai Hiwatari. You're about
to get sent to hell.

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:40.560
How unexpected! After fighting so many passive battles...

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:46.440
Brooklyn's Zeus has unleashed an attack that's just like Hiwatari's!

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.820
They're still even!

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:12.370
Brooklyn's fighting toe
to toe with Hiwatari!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:15.220
Just who is he?

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.800
Wow!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:25.010
You can't pull off moves like that without thinking two or three steps ahead!

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.610
How does he know?

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.890
He can see the
Bey's movements.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:35.300
But isn't this
their first fight?

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:40.460
It doesn't matter
who Brooklyn fights.

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:44.880
He can understand any Bey's
movement patterns in an instant!

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.580
No way!

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:53.680
Brooklyn can even
copy moves on first sight.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.850
So he's like,
totally unbeatable!

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:05.210
Natural disposition and technique. He is a genius, after all.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:07.620
A natural...

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:10.140
Yes. But Brooklyn...

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:14.320
He's never seriously practiced before. He's never had the need!

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:18.540
I can only call it
natural born talent.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:22.690
For those who've shed
blood in their hard work...

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:25.080
It is truly hell!

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:27.380
It's unbearably humiliating!

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.260
Like this?

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.320
What?!

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:02.540
Sort of like this?

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:06.740
Kai!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:11.250
There's no way! I've never seen Kai get pushed around like this!

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:17.960
And Brooklyn has barely taken
any damage from Kai's attacks!

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:21.840
They had this secret weapon
lying in wait the whole time?!

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:26.480
Do something, Kai!
You better not lose!

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:34.420
That's right! The only reason I'm here is to fight Kinomiya again.

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:36.330
I would never...

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:45.490
Blazing Gig Tempest!!

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:31.980
Hey...
This is sort of fun.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:41.920
What...?

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.860
What is...

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:03.770
This is pathetic, Kai Hiwatari.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:10.110
You should understand by now
that this is no mere power gap.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:16.140
It's a gap in talent. You're not made
of the same stuff Brooklyn is.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:19.860
Talent?
Not made of...?

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:23.440
This isn't a gap you can
clear with hard work.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:26.090
You will never reach him.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:28.690
I might even say
this is god's domain.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:41.640
We are going to continue to find
and develop boys like Brooklyn.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:46.690
The chosen will compete,
talent versus talent.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:50.170
That's BEGA.
That's the pro world!

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:55.540
Their goal is different compared to your mere
obsession with reaching Takao Kinomiya.

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:58.530
Their goal is different?!

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:00.680
Mere obsession?!

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:04.980
Shut your mouth! You don't
know a damn thing about us!

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:10.640
But I do. I know your dedication to hard
work for the sole purpose of beating Takao.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:15.260
Your willingness to battle Takao at the cost of joining BEGA.

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:19.640
But none of that will do
any good against Brooklyn.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.600
Yes. That is reality.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:25.490
There is no
place for you here!

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:37.010
The talented win?

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:38.610
No!

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:41.730
Beyblading isn't just about
power and fancy moves!

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:45.460
My Beybattles with him...

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:49.050
Mean much
more than that!!

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:56.180
Go, Dranzer!!!

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:11.080
Oh, jeez...

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:16.050
I finally got in the mood...

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.680
And you're
trying to end it?

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:25.000
Well, I guess that's
just how it is.

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:39.100
Farewell.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.920
King of Darkness.

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:20.460
Brooklyn wins!

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:24.760
Where does his strength come from? Where was he all this time?!

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:27.400
Well? Was it fun?

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:34.930
Yes. But I enjoyed his hot-headed
attitude more than the actual battle.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:40.490
BEGA's chosen members
have been decided!

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:42.600
No one cares!

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.400
What happened to Kai?!
Show Kai!

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:48.690
I can't wait for the
day of the match!

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:53.520
I'll see you all at the
arena for the Justice 5!

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:54.940
See ya!

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:56.220
Kai...!

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:10.940
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:17.420
Our five VS five battle with BEGA, the Justice 5, is about to start.

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:20.560
As you know, BEGA's
team is composed of...

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:26.950
Garland, Mystel, Moses,
Ming-Ming, and Brooklyn.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:32.580
The first day will have
three matches. Then a break.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.690
And then two matches
on the last day.

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:42.180
It's reasonable to think that Garland
and Brooklyn will be on the last day.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.720
Who fights whom?

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:49.530
And deciding the order
is going to be the issue.

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:52.540
Yes. That, and well...

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:59.090
I have no idea what kinds
of strategies they'll employ.

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:01.930
What kinda strategies?

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:04.560
We're up against Volkov.

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:08.290
We don't know what kind
of tricks he'll pull to win.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:14.460
We don't have to worry about that.
Brooklyn and the rest of them are truly strong.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:21.060
Despite being with Volkov, they want to beat us head-on and show off BEGA's power.

00:12:21.060 --> 00:12:27.860
But forcing them to play dirty is exactly what happened with Barthez in the world championships.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:36.010
Even then, Volkov tried to use his ID
system to force us out of Beyblading.

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:40.340
So his tricks aren't limited to happening in the stadium.

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:42.290
We have to stay
on our guard.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:44.220
Gotta be careful.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:50.410
They're a real pain in
the rear to deal with.

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:53.320
I know it's best
to be careful.

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:55.770
But whatever happens, happens!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:03.860
Whatever they do, we just have
fight the way we believe in.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:08.820
Yeah! Let's show 'em what
our Beyspirits are made of!

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:09.970
Yes.

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:13.220
We have a bigger
problem, Mr. Leader.

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:17.400
What about our team?

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:21.640
The people who mastered the Heavy Metal Beys are you and Daichi.

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:24.650
I have no complaints
over Max and Rei, either.

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:26.860
So we're one short.

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:32.820
We can't really come up with a
plan if we don't have a full team.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:37.680
None of us could master
the Heavy Metal System.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:40.680
But we still have these!

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:45.480
We're all ready to go.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.640
So hurry up and
pick someone!

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:50.060
Well...

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.320
Thank you. All of you.

00:13:56.610 --> 00:14:00.200
But I'm still thinking.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:03.420
Sorry. But just
wait a little longer.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.660
I can't put up with this!

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:09.930
A little longer?
The match is tomorrow!

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:13.060
Forget it! I'll go!

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:17.130
No! You're such a hothead!

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:20.400
I really think we
should have a girl!

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.240
Right?

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:29.920
Takao?

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:44.010
I'm really happy that
you all feel this way.

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:48.370
But one more...
If I could, I'd...

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:49.700
Takao!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:53.300
What're you doing
out here by yourself?

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:55.810
Oh, nothing.

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:58.360
You had the same
idea in mind, right?

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:01.800
But we can't.

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:07.530
Kai's so prideful I doubt he'd
ever come back to our side.

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:12.290
Just in case, I
did prepare this.

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:15.370
Though it'll end
up going to waste.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.420
Kyoujyu...

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:27.240
Kai, where are you?

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:36.790
The fated day
has finally arrived!

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:39.840
The showdown to decide
the future of Beyblading!

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:46.000
Which team will win and
take home all the glory?!

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:56.210
A ton of fans are flooding to the
arena, excited to see the matches!

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:04.900
And of course I'll be giving
the play-by-play for it all!

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:15.320
'Sup, old Daitenji!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.620
Excuse us!

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:19.220
Thanks for coming.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:21.380
Especially during such
an important moment.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:23.960
We're here
because it's important!

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:28.410
We came to let Yuriy know
our determination to win!

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:32.420
How nice. I'm sure Yuriy
will be glad to hear that.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:35.400
Yuriy...

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:37.080
Hang in there, Yuriy.

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:38.970
We're going
fight our best.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:44.520
The world of Beyblading you
tried to protect is in our hands!

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:47.480
You're one of our
friends, after all!

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.690
I believe in you all.

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:55.410
Any sort of revolution in the world of
Beyblade shouldn't be caused by BEGA.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:17:00.770
It's you all, who love Beyblade
with all your hearts.

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:03.680
A revolution from
the young generation.

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:07.940
That's it! From now on,
you're the G-Revolutions!

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:11.170
--G-Revolutions?

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:13.100
Yeah! Let's do this!

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:16.570
Yeah! Watch over
us, old Daitenji!

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:27.930
Yuriy. Watch over this too.

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:43.360
Sorry for the wait!

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:47.080
It's time to
start the Justice 5!

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:52.730
Here comes BEGA's
team of pro Bladers!

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:55.500
These five will represent BEGA!

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:58.520
The furious working man! Moses!

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:01.520
Mystel, embodiment
of water and wind!

00:18:01.520 --> 00:18:04.540
Our favorite pop
star, Ming-Ming!

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:07.930
Hailing from powerful
family ties, Garland!

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:13.480
And the boy genius who came
out of nowhere! Brooklyn!

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:16.020
Yeah! BEGA rules!

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:18.490
Go for it Ming-Ming!

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:22.240
Their opponents!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:28.290
The G-Revolutions led by world
champion Takao Kinomiya!

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:32.920
The time has come!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:38.080
Volkov, you will never
take over our Beyblading!

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:42.020
I don't know what
you're up to, Hitoshi.

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:45.970
But we have to do this!
We just have to fight!

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.580
And their team...

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:50.680
Wait. Huh?

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:54.530
The people who came with
Kinomiya are... Daichi Sumeragi.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:57.420
And Rei, and Max.
And that's it.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:59.970
What's the meaning of this?

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.330
What the heck?!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.490
They're one Blader short!

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:11.460
Kinomiya, this is a five
VS five team battle.

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:13.460
Where's your last member?

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:16.000
It's... X.

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:21.690
I said our last
member is Mister X!

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.090
What the hell?

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:34.000
This isn't a joke!

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:37.330
Are you screwing around
because you can't win?

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:39.480
His ass is grass!

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:41.050
Lay off, Rick!

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:42.880
Calm down!

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:50.500
This was never
going to work.

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:54.650
Cute.

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:57.160
How cute, Kinomiya.

00:19:57.160 --> 00:20:00.160
I didn't think you had
a sense of humor.

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:04.970
Welcome, Mister X!
Let's start the match.

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:07.080
But...

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:11.920
I'm sure they just haven't
decided on their last member.

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:15.770
They have until the last
match to figure that out.

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:19.850
BEGA isn't bothered
by little details like that.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:27.420
And well, if we win three times,
our victory is sealed.

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:32.900
They might not even
need a fifth member.

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:35.400
He's so confident!

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:38.010
You're so awesome, Volkov!

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.450
Keep running
your mouth, Volkov!

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:47.700
Allow me to reveal the Bladers
playing on day one!

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:55.900
They've left the first battle to the up-and-coming Daichi Sumeragi!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:21:01.120
No going back! We just have
to win, and keep winning!

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:02.890
We're counting on you, Daichi.

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:04.400
You can do it.

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:06.600
Yeah, just leave it to me!

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:09.000
His opponent from
the BEGA team...

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:18.090
Wow! It's Ming-Ming,
the chart-topping pop singer!

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:26.290
I gotta fight the
fancy pants pop star?

00:22:55.700 --> 00:23:00.650
I gotta fight the singer?
This sucks!

00:23:00.650 --> 00:23:04.420
Time for our first win!
I'm not holding back!

00:23:04.420 --> 00:23:06.810
Don't underestimate me!

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:11.560
Ming-Ming's always 100% serious
when it comes to battling and singing!

00:23:11.560 --> 00:23:15.040
I'll show you what I'm
made of! Are you ready?
